<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary" start="5">
<li class="break-words">Normative Architecture of Useful Computation</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Ban on purely speculative proof-of-work systems.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Policy framework for Useful Compute Mandates in heat-generating installations.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Public Research Object (PRO) as a unit of validated useful computation.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Incentive structures: computation-as-currency but tied to scientific or environmental value.</p>
<hr class="border-border-l2">
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary" start="6">
<li class="break-words">Integration with RSVP Theory</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Entropy mapping between semantic infrastructure and RSVP fields.</p>
