<li class="break-words">Eliminate Unproductive Heaters
All resistive heaters, space heaters, and non-computational heat sources in controlled environments shall be replaced with general-purpose or specialized compute units (GPUs, TPUs, or domain-specific accelerators) optimized for epistemically valuable workloads.</li>
<li class="break-words">Ban Waste-Only Cryptographic Mining
Cryptographic mining whose sole output is chain validation without additional epistemic yield shall be prohibited in favor of multiplexed proof-of-useful-work-and-heat (PoUWH) tasks.</li>
<li class="break-words">Mandate Useful Workloads
Acceptable computation includes:</li>
</ol>
