<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">5.3 Cymatic Yogurt Computing (CYC)</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">We propose an extension of the PoUWH framework into cymatic yogurt computing, wherein liquid or gel-based media (e.g., yogurt cultures) are used as both:</p>
