<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The lunar colony heating problem exemplifies the inefficiency of traditional proposals:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Some suggest blockchain mining for lunar heaters as a funding + thermal solution.</p>
