</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(194.4px);"><span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\usetikzlibrary</span><span>{arrows,positioning,shapes}
