<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\section{Semantic Infrastructure in a Fibered Symmetric Monoidal Category}
\label{app:semantic-infra}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">We define ( \mathbf{Sem} ) as a fibered symmetric monoidal category over ( \mathbf{Dom} ).</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\subsection{Objects and Morphisms}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">An object ( M = (F, \Sigma, D, \varphi) ):</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">( F ): Finite set of function hashes.</li>
<li class="break-words">( \Sigma ): Semantic type annotations.</li>
