<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Coupling equation:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[ \frac{\partial S}{\partial t} + \nabla \cdot (\vec{v} S) = \sigma_{\text{comp}} - \sigma_{\text{loss}}. ]</p>
