<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">Notes on Changes and Enhancements</h3>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">CLIO Integration</strong>: The CLIO module is explicitly referenced to \citet{ChengBroadbentChappell2025}, with its definition updated to reflect the paperâ€™s focus on self-adaptive reasoning, steerability, and uncertainty-driven optimization. The essay emphasizes CLIOâ€™s role in enabling transparent and controllable inference, enhancing its applicability to polycomputational agency.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Expanded Content</strong>: Each section has been extended with additional details:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Introduction</strong>: Elaborates on the historical context of infrastructure assumptions and the thermodynamic impact of modern computing.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Categorical Foundations</strong>: Includes deeper discussion on cross-domain interoperability and temporal robustness via homotopy colimits.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">CLIO and Polycomputation</strong>: Expands on CLIOâ€™s uncertainty oscillations and 2-categorical structures for hybrid reasoning.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Bioeconomic Thermoregulation</strong>: Provides detailed examples of terrestrial and lunar applications, emphasizing bioeconomic alignment.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Normative Architecture</strong>: Details enforcement mechanisms and phased transitions.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">RSVP Integration</strong>: Highlights optimization techniques within RSVP fields.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Case Studies</strong>: Quantifies simulation results for clarity.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Appendices</strong>: All appendices are fully expanded with proofs and interpretations, including the new CLIO citation where relevant. String diagrams are included in LaTeX using TikZ for visualization.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">BibTeX</strong>: The bibliography includes the new CLIO reference with the correct arXiv identifier and formatting, ensuring compatibility with the <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">plain</span> bibliography style.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">LaTeX Formatting</strong>: The document is structured for PDF compilation, with proper sectioning, mathematical rigor, and professional presentation. The TikZ diagrams are included in the appendix for visual clarity.</li>
</ol>
