n><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">âŠ†</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">Î£</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">Î¼</span><span class="mclose">))</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></p>
